Package: markdownmate
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, libspelling-1-1
Description: local-first, native Markdown note-taking app
 MarkdownMate keeps notes as plain .md files in your own folders: no cloud,
 no account, no telemetry. It is a GTK 4 + libadwaita app with a Markdown
 editor, live preview, wiki links, tags, quick open and search in folder.
